<title>UK: Standa prices 250 bln lire seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Standa prices 250 bln lire seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced earlier by lead manager Bankers Trust and Cassa di Risparmio delle Provincie Lombarde has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STANDA LUXEMBOURG SA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  STANDA SPA</p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    31.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     95 BP     PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.75     ISS PRICE  99.75     FULL FEES   0.40</p>
<p> LISTING    =	   DENOMS (M) 5-250     SALE LIMITS US/GB/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.30	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
